		CppUnit --- The C++ Unit Test Library
		-------------------------------------
            http://www.freedesktop.org/wiki/Software/cppunit

CppUnit is the C++ port of the famous JUnit framework for unit
testing.

This version has had everything to do with GNU autotools stripped
from it by Erik Corry.  To use it in your project, add the include
directory to your include directories and add the cpp files to
your build system.  I'm afraid I can't be more specific than that.
